import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 653 | Quest-Domain Depth | Meaning-of-Life Construction in the Quest Domain","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 653 | Quest-Domain Depth | Meaning-of-Life Construction in the Quest Domain","no":653,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Domain","Life Meaning","Meaning Construction","Quest Sediment Domain","Existential Meaning"],"related":["07-Self-Generated-Self-Growing Evolution Law","09-Reality-Based Fundamental Stance","26-Individual-Collective-Balance Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0653_模块3-求索域深度-求索域中的生命意义建构.md","filePath":"en/0653_模块3-求索域深度-求索域中的生命意义建构.md"}'),o={name:"en/0653_模块3-求索域深度-求索域中的生命意义建构.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,h,c){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-653-quest-domain-depth-meaning-of-life-construction-in-the-quest-domain" tabindex="-1">Entry 653 | Quest-Domain Depth | Meaning-of-Life Construction in the Quest Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-653-quest-domain-depth-meaning-of-life-construction-in-the-quest-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 653 | Quest-Domain Depth | Meaning-of-Life Construction in the Quest Domain&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 07, 09, 26 | Series: Quest-Domain Depth (Entry 6 · Quest-Domain-Depth Conclusion)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-living-long-is-not-the-same-as-living-meaningfully" tabindex="-1">Introduction: living long is not the same as living meaningfully <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-living-long-is-not-the-same-as-living-meaningfully" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: living long is not the same as living meaningfully&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The most fundamental spiritual crisis of predatory-faction systems is: after cultivators live thousands or tens of thousands of years and reach the peak of power, they find they do not know why they are living. The older-generation Great Emperors in Shrouding-the-Heavens emerge from seclusion facing an empty cosmos; the alone-in-an-era Shi Hao in Perfect World — these are all &quot;meaning vacuums after the peak of power.&quot; This vacuum is not a technical problem, but a meaning problem: <strong>when the single goal of &quot;getting stronger&quot; is completed, what meaning does life still have?</strong></p><p>Six top-level axioms here become the framework for meaning construction: anti-predation axiom requires meaning not be built on plundering others; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires meaning be connected with Myriad-Rank co-building; collective ascension axiom requires meaning serve civilizational progress; causal self-discipline axiom requires meaning construction not fabricate false causality; law-first axiom requires meaning-construction&#39;s law framework stable and self-consistent. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry analyzes the mechanism of meaning-of-life construction in the Quest Sediment Domain.</p><h2 id="i-three-sources-of-the-meaning-vacuum" tabindex="-1">I. Three Sources of the Meaning Vacuum <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-sources-of-the-meaning-vacuum" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Sources of the Meaning Vacuum&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-vacuum-after-goal-completion" tabindex="-1">1.1 Vacuum After Goal Completion <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-vacuum-after-goal-completion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Vacuum After Goal Completion&quot;">​</a></h3><p>In predatory-faction systems, cultivation&#39;s single goal is &quot;getting stronger.&quot; When this goal is completed — becoming the universe&#39;s strongest, unmatched — the cultivator loses direction for continuing forward. This is the most direct meaning vacuum.</p><h3 id="_1-2-vacuum-after-loneliness" tabindex="-1">1.2 Vacuum After Loneliness <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-vacuum-after-loneliness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Vacuum After Loneliness&quot;">​</a></h3><p>In predatory-faction systems there is an unbridgeable chasm between the strong and mortals. The strong one who lived ten thousand years looks around; friends, rivals, companions of his time have all turned to dust. He lives in a universe with no contemporaries — this existential loneliness is the second source of the meaning vacuum.</p><h3 id="_1-3-vacuum-after-predation" tabindex="-1">1.3 Vacuum After Predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-vacuum-after-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Vacuum After Predation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The deepest meaning vacuum comes from predation itself: the cultivator gets stronger by plundering others&#39; energy, and in the process he vaguely knows the power he gained &quot;has improper origins.&quot; Even when power reaches the peak, this hidden wound of &quot;improper origins&quot; always corrodes his subconscious confirmation of life&#39;s meaning. This is the ultimate form of the beings&#39; origin-attachment · shortcut inner demon: power is in hand, but the heart is not at peace.</p><h2 id="ii-the-quest-sediment-domain-s-three-layer-response-to-the-meaning-vacuum" tabindex="-1">II. The Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s Three-Layer Response to the Meaning Vacuum <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-quest-sediment-domain-s-three-layer-response-to-the-meaning-vacuum" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s Three-Layer Response to the Meaning Vacuum&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-layer-1-response-meaning-is-not-given-but-constructed" tabindex="-1">2.1 Layer 1 Response: Meaning Is Not Given, But Constructed <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-layer-1-response-meaning-is-not-given-but-constructed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Layer 1 Response: Meaning Is Not Given, But Constructed&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Quest Domain does not provide a ready-made &quot;life-meaning manual.&quot; Its stance is: meaning is not an answer received from outside, but constructed by the cultivator in his own experiences. The five stages of Dao-realization (Entry 649) ultimately point to letting the cultivator himself construct his own understanding of life&#39;s meaning — this understanding does not come from scriptures or from teachers, but from everything he himself experiences in the Quest Domain.</p><h3 id="_2-2-layer-2-response-meaning-is-connected-with-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">2.2 Layer 2 Response: Meaning Is Connected with Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-layer-2-response-meaning-is-connected-with-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Layer 2 Response: Meaning Is Connected with Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Quest Domain through Myriad-Rank relationship deepening (Entry 652), joint epic experiences (Entry 648), civilizational-memory learning (Entry 650), lets the cultivator&#39;s meaning construction not be an isolated &quot;who am I,&quot; but &quot;who am I among Myriad Ranks.&quot; Meaning is not found in loneliness, but grows in connection with Myriad Ranks. This directly responds to the post-loneliness vacuum — when you know you are a node in the Myriad-Rank co-building network, you are no longer the only being in the universe.</p><h3 id="_2-3-layer-3-response-meaning-is-connected-with-contribution" tabindex="-1">2.3 Layer 3 Response: Meaning Is Connected with Contribution <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-layer-3-response-meaning-is-connected-with-contribution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Layer 3 Response: Meaning Is Connected with Contribution&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Quest Domain guides the cultivator to connect his own sense of meaning with his contribution to Myriad Ranks. This is not saying &quot;you must live for others&quot; — but saying, when you discover your existence contributes to Myriad-Rank progress, a sense of meaning naturally grows. The joint-contracting more-work-more-gain mechanism under the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision (Document 22) provides this contribution feedback: every bit of your investment has record, feedback, impact. Knowing your existence makes Myriad Ranks better — this is the most concrete sense of meaning.</p><h2 id="iii-four-stages-of-meaning-construction" tabindex="-1">III. Four Stages of Meaning Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-four-stages-of-meaning-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Four Stages of Meaning Construction&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Content</th><th>Implementation in the Quest Domain</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Inquiry</td><td>&quot;Why am I living?&quot;</td><td>Naturally emerges in the perplexity period (Entry 649)</td></tr><tr><td>Exploration</td><td>Trying different life ways and contribution directions</td><td>Trial-and-error through immersive scenes in the exploration period</td></tr><tr><td>Confirmation</td><td>Finding a meaning direction that resonates with one&#39;s own nature</td><td>Forming personal meaning understanding in the breakthrough period</td></tr><tr><td>Lived Out</td><td>Extending meaning understanding into daily cultivation and life</td><td>Gradual practice in the integration period</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The four stages are not completed linearly and then ended — it is a cycle: as the cultivator grows, meaning understanding continuously deepens, revises, expands.</p><h2 id="iv-contrast-with-the-predatory-faction-s-afk-retirement" tabindex="-1">IV. Contrast with the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;AFK Retirement&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-contrast-with-the-predatory-faction-s-afk-retirement" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Contrast with the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;AFK Retirement&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In predatory-faction systems, the standard option for the strong after reaching the peak is &quot;AFK retirement&quot; — finding a place to seclude and sleep, or wandering aimlessly in the universe. This is not because they do not want to do anything, but because the meaning vacuum leaves them not knowing what to do. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Quest Sediment Domain precisely provides what predatory-faction systems lack: <strong>it lets cultivators, after getting stronger, still have deeper spiritual worlds to explore, still have Myriad-Rank co-building causes to participate in, still have meaning to continuously construct</strong>. This is why Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcendent ones do not AFK-retire, but eternally build (links to Entry 656).</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: meaning construction converts &quot;spiritual emptiness&quot; this implicit waste into directional spiritual growth — a cultivator with a sense of meaning is the truly efficient cultivator</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: directly cuts off &quot;the meaning vacuum after predation&quot; — meaning is not built on plundering others, but on contribution to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo strong ones AFK-retire or have nothing to do after reaching the peak; Heng Yuan Zhou cultivators continuously construct meaning in the Quest Domain, never stagnating</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: meaning construction is equally open to all beings of Myriad Ranks; each clan&#39;s cultivators may in the Quest Domain find their own meaning path</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: meaning-construction four-stage model, three-layer response framework all public; newly merged planes接入 the same meaning-guidance system; the spiritual-meaning infrastructure leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Living long is not the same as living meaningfully. Predatory-faction systems give cultivators long lifespans, but give them no meaning — the ultimate result is AFK retirement or nihilistic wandering. The Quest Sediment Domain is precisely the opposite: it does not rush cultivators to &quot;get stronger&quot;; it uses four stages — inquiry, exploration, confirmation, lived out — to help every cultivator within the Myriad-Rank co-building framework construct his own meaning of life. <strong>The Origin Acceleration Domain gives civilization power; the Quest domain gives life meaning — dual-track synergy is a civilization with both power and meaning</strong>.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/07-自生自长进化法则.html">Entry 07 · Self-Generated-Self-Growing Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/09-现实为基根本立场.html">Entry 09 · Reality-Based Fundamental Stance</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">Entry 26 · Individual-Collective-Balance Principle</a> · <a href="./654_模块3-时间域与超脱-超脱者的时间域权限.html">Entry 654 · Time-Domain Authority of the Transcendent Ones</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=n(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
